; Models: a laser zap, a square falling from 3 kHz to 150 Hz in a quarter second, twice | Neglects: everything but the sweep | IO: (t) -> amplitude | Tags: fx
crop(0.75*lowpass(sample(square(3000, -2*pi*2850*(t - 0.05*(1 - exp(-t/0.05))))*exp(-t/0.12) + 0.6*step(t - 0.18)*square(3000, -2*pi*2850*(t - 0.18 - 0.05*(1 - exp(-(t - 0.18)/0.05))))*exp(-(t - 0.18)/0.12)), cutoff=6000, q=0.7), 0s, 0.6s, rise=0.0005s, fall=0.1s)
